<title>UK: UK airport April cargo tonnages up 8 pct  -- CAA.</title>
<headline>UK airport April cargo tonnages up 8 pct  -- CAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo tonnages handled at UK airports totalled 152,422 tonnes in April this year, an eight percent rise over the 141,593 tonnes for the same month in 1997, UK Civil Aviation Authority figures show.</p>
<p>The following tables show tonnages handled at the main airports, the total for all UK airports and the breakdown between tonnes shipped on passenger and cargo aircraft. 1. Tonnages handled at main cargo airports (in tonnes with percentage</p>
<p>change over April 1996)</p>
<p>   Airport		April	 April    Percent</p>
<p>			    1997	  1996     Change</p>
<p>   Heathrow	     88,055	83,021    +  6</p>
<p>   Gatwick		21,872	21,299    +  3</p>
<p>   E.Midlands	   10,985	 8,323    + 32</p>
<p>   Stansted	     10,509	 8,441    + 24</p>
<p>   Manchester	    6,909	 5,594    + 24</p>
<p>   Prestwick	     2,334	 1,626    + 44</p>
<p>   Liverpool	     1,970	 2,556    - 23</p>
<p>   Total UK	    152,422     141,543    +  8</p>
<p>2. Cargo handled at main UK airports by passenger/cargo aircraft</p>
<p>		  Passenger			Cargo</p>
<p>		  April    April    Pct	 April    April   Pct</p>
<p>		  1997     1996		   1997     1996</p>
<p>   Heathrow   80,545   76,262   +  6	7,510    6,759   + 11</p>
<p>   Gatwick    18,313   16,690   - 10	3,559    4,609   - 23</p>
<p>   E.Midlands     19	 24   - 21     10,966    8,299   + 32</p>
<p>   Stansted	535	335   + 60	9,974    8,106   + 23</p>
<p>   Manchester  4,667    3,785   + 23	2,242    1,809   + 24</p>
<p>   Prestwick	13	  1   + 1,200   2,321    1,625   + 43</p>
<p>   Liverpool	29	 18   + 16	1,941    2,538   - 24</p>
<p>   Total UK  106,605   99,535   +  7     45,817   42,058   +  9</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
